ded December 31, Change\n(In thousands) 2025 2024 2025 vs. 2024\nRevenues, net:\nSubscription $ 188,417 $ 196,924 (4.3) %\nAdvertising 104,050 115,333 (9.8) %\nContent licensing and other 11,498 12,771 (10.0) %\nTotal revenues, net 303,965 325,028 (6.5) %\nTechnical and operating expenses (excluding depreciation and amortization) 145,359 148,539 (2.1) %\nSelling, general and administrative expenses(a) 115,426 111,584 3.4 %\nSegment adjusted operating income $ 43,180 $ 64,905 (33.5) %\n(a) Selling, general and administrative expenses excludes share-based compensation expenses\n"}
